d_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.5.dev1.official [97241ffea]\n- Reproducible in v4.4.1.rc1.official [daa4b058e]\n- Reproducible in v4.3.stable.official [77dcf97d8]\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6636) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-13600KF (20 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bf834456-84d5-4681-8edd-deb5850a2c1b)\n\nThe automatically generated `%NodeXXX` (by Ctrl+Drag) is an invalid accessing name to get this node. The correct name should be\n`$SceneA/NodeXXX`\n\nsee: https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/scripting/scene_unique_nodes.html#same-scene-limitation\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. create a scene\n2. add a root node\n3. add a child node under root node and set `Access as Unique Name`  to true\n4. create another scene\n5. add a root node\n6. add the first scene to this scene and set `Editable Children` to true\n7. add a script\n8. Ctrl+drag the node which has a \"%\" to the editor. \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test_unique_name_in_editable_children_2025-03-24_17-43-15.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19427124/test_unique_name_in_editable_children_2025-03-24_17-43-15.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104545/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104545/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}